 "description": "electrical.imu current_draw is 90 mA in normal mode. The LSM6DS33 draws 0.9 mA with gyro and accelerometer in normal mode (R8.05) and 1.25 mA in high-performance mode (R8.04), so it should be 0.9 mA. 90 is the accelerometer noise density figure of R8.14. 90 mA is 100 times the part's rating and 72 times its highest-power mode, which is not plausible for a MEMS IMU. It also disagrees with the 0.140 W the 5 V regulator node carries for this load.",
